swtier 1
# Reactor Run's graphics release tier (docs/ReleaseTier.md): what the release draws with.
# Checked by `player --check --release`; shown by `player --release-tier`.

# The lowest preset the game supports. Minimum-tier pictures are taken with it.
fallback low

# The sun is the only light: without its shadows the rooms read as flat boxes.
mandatory shadow_quality low "the sun's shadows are how the rooms read as lit spaces"
